rease as the militarization of the police (state) continues.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyone breaking down my door will be met with violence of action in the form of 9 pellets of 00 lead aimed for the head. Period. I don&amp;#39;t care what gang of thugs they belong too, or what colors they&amp;#39;re flying, even if it&amp;#39;s blue or black with white lettering.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Also, consider this: The members of a Mexican Drug Cartel were wearing the typical gear for members of the real Phoenix SWAT Team: black boots, black BDU pants, Kevlar helmets and Phoenix Police Department (PPD) raid shirts pulled over their body armor. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.stratfor.com/weekly/mexican_cartels_and_fallout_phoenix</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/6162954728694342482'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/6162954728694342482'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392418315969#c6162954728694342482' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1523406014"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 14, 2014 at 3:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3814531587048284536</id><published>2014-02-14T13:58:52.112-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-14T13:58:52.112-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Someone should tell esteemed party member Comrade ...</title><content type='html'>Someone should tell esteemed party member Comrade Commissar potHolder or President Messiah the one about this.&lt;br /&gt;The injustice would be smited down in seconds by the greatest human being ever to walk the face of the earth, Chicago Jesus.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/3814531587048284536'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/3814531587048284536'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392411532112#c3814531587048284536' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-308198248"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 14, 2014 at 1:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6489023054856037401</id><published>2014-02-14T06:23:34.571-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-14T06:23:34.571-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for the clarification, I wasn&amp;#39;t sure of...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for the clarification, I wasn&amp;#39;t sure of the background info you were presenting. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately, the .gov &amp;quot;authorities&amp;quot; only give lip service to the recognition of the Rights we still partially have, otherwise there would be a lot more cases with this outcome which means the cops wouldn&amp;#39;t be doing the no knock raids like this, or there would be a lot more info to post on policemisconduct.net </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/6489023054856037401'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/6489023054856037401'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392384214571#c6489023054856037401' title=''/><author><name>Grog</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-522491547"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 14, 2014 at 6:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7137890789307742120</id><published>2014-02-13T21:41:02.877-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-13T21:41:02.877-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Grog, I&amp;#39;m grateful for any constructive critic...</title><content type='html'>Grog, I&amp;#39;m grateful for any constructive criticism or feedback, and you make a valid point. I used the word &amp;quot;legal&amp;quot; because there is a long line of precedents reaching back to the Supreme Court&amp;#39;s Bad Elk v. US ruling recognizing the right of citizens to use lethal force in self-defense against unlawful police aggression. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Such action by a citizen is not only &lt;i&gt;lawful&lt;/i&gt; -- meaning an exercise of a natural right -- but also &lt;i&gt;legal&lt;/i&gt; -- meaning that it is recognized as valid by government &amp;quot;authorities.&amp;quot; I&amp;#39;m not sure that&amp;#39;s how other people define that distinction, and I&amp;#39;m sorry if my choice resulted in confusion.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/7137890789307742120'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/7137890789307742120'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392352862877#c7137890789307742120' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 13, 2014 at 9:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5464566537299295828</id><published>2014-02-13T19:05:55.588-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-13T19:05:55.588-07:00</updated><title type='text'>William, regarding this sentence: &amp;quot;It is comp...</title><content type='html'>William, regarding this sentence: &amp;quot;It is compounded by the fact that Magee had a moral and legal right to kill him, just as he has the right to use deadly force in dealing with any other armed invader.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I don&amp;#39;t wish to appear as if I&amp;#39;m telling you how to write, but wouldn&amp;#39;t the word lawful be a better choice than legal to detail the right to self defense that we Citizens still have a percentage of? </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/5464566537299295828'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/5464566537299295828'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392343555588#c5464566537299295828' title=''/><author><name>Grog</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-849883480"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 13, 2014 at 7:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9160131876222451669</id><published>2014-02-12T22:24:32.171-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-12T22:24:32.171-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Who are the criminals and who are the bad guys (rh...</title><content type='html'>Who are the criminals and who are the bad guys (rhetorical):&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://legalinsurrection.com/2014/02/holder-wants-felons-to-vote/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/9160131876222451669'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7351804894957224083/comments/default/9160131876222451669'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html?showComment=1392269072171#c9160131876222451669' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/henry-magee-john-quinn-and-right-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7351804894957224083' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7351804894957224083' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-308198248"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 12, 2014 at 10:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2773300995226573416</id><published>2014-02-12T14:03:43.842-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-12T14:03:43.842-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Francisco:&#xa;If they did it the way you describe, th...</title><content type='html'>Francisco:&lt;br /&gt;If they did it the way you describe, then they couldn&amp;#39;t justify to the public the need for more of the military-type equipment they employ, thus the tax money it takes to buy all that stuff.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/ato